'''''Isothecium''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Lembophyllaceae]]. The genus has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Isothecium |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2673550 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=21 February 2021 |language=en |archive-date=17 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211217023736/https://www.gbif.org/species/2673550 |url-status=live }}</ref>

